?Agency? means Command Area Development Agency constituted under Agricultural and Rural Area Development
Agency Act, 1978 (Bihar Act 3, 1979);
(iii)
?Government? means Government of Bihar;
(iv)
?Rules? means rules made by the State Government under Section-38 of the Bihar Agricultural and Rural Area
